{"pageid": 208, "title": "Baran bo Odar", "revid": 265, "categories": ["Crew"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Baran bo Odar</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/68/Baran_bo_Odar.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230225163552\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Baran bo Odar\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/68/Baran_bo_Odar.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230225163552\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/68/Baran_bo_Odar.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230225163552 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/68/Baran_bo_Odar.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230225163552 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Baran bo Odar\" width=\"270\" height=\"332\" data-image-key=\"Baran_bo_Odar.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Baran bo Odar.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_place\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Place</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Olten, Switzerland</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"birth_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Birth Date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 18, 1978</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"role\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Role</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Co-showrunner<br />Executive producer<br />Writer</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Baran bo Odar</b> is a German co-showrunner, executive producer, and writer on the <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> original supernatural drama, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(TV_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (TV series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Biography\">Biography</span></h2>\n<p>Odar and his wife, <a href=\"/wiki/Jantje_Friese\" title=\"Jantje Friese\">Jantje Friese</a>, are best known for creating the hit <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> science fiction series <i><a href=\"https://dark-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/Dark\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dark-netflix:Dark\">Dark</a></i>, which ran for three seasons before coming to a pre-planned end. In the years that followed, the duo announced their next big production at Netflix, <i><a href=\"https://1899-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/1899_(TV_series)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:1899-netflix:1899 (TV series)\">1899</a></i>, a multilingual mystery thriller that was also planned to run for three seasons but was canceled prematurely by the streaming service.\n</p><p>After renewing their first-look overall deal with Netflix, Odar and Friese were tapped to develop a series adaptation of the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://stati